    "settings.mcp.agentSetup.cliPrompt" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "# Install and Verify Starcat CLI\n\n## Goal\n\nThe current AI Agent installs the official Starcat CLI and completes version and read-only diagnostic checks.\n\nOfficial repository:\n\n```text\n%1$@\n```\n\n## Installation\n\n### 1. Detect the operating system\n\nSelect the official command for the current environment.\n\nmacOS / Linux:\n\n```bash\n%2$@\n```\n\nWindows PowerShell:\n\n```powershell\n%3$@\n```\n\n### 2. Check the CLI version\n\n```bash\nstarcat version\n```\n\nIf the current macOS/Linux shell has not refreshed PATH, use:\n\n```bash\n\"$HOME/.local/bin/starcat\" version\n```\n\nOn Windows PowerShell, locate the installation with:\n\n```powershell\n(Get-Command starcat).Source\n```\n\n### 3. Run read-only diagnostics\n\n```bash\nstarcat doctor\n```\n\nIf the current macOS/Linux shell has not refreshed PATH, use:\n\n```bash\n\"$HOME/.local/bin/starcat\" doctor\n```\n\n### 4. Handle an unpaired CLI\n\nIf diagnostics report that the CLI is not paired:\n\n1. Stop further connection verification.\n2. Report that the Starcat CLI is installed but not paired.\n3. Instruct the user to open **Starcat > Settings > MCP**.\n4. Instruct the user to use Starcat's **Copy Pairing Prompt** action to complete pairing.\n5. Do not request a standalone pairing URI or Local API Key from the user.\n\n## Boundaries\n\n- Use only Starcat's official installer.\n- Do not modify project files.\n- Do not execute Starcat write commands.\n- Do not request a Local API Key.\n- Do not construct a pairing URI or pairing command.\n- Unless installation fails, do not fetch extra GitHub Release API responses or print installer source.\n\n## Final Report\n\nThe current AI Agent reports:\n\n- Operating system and CPU architecture\n- Whether installation succeeded\n- CLI installation path\n- CLI version\n- `starcat doctor` result\n- Whether the user must continue with device pairing"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "# 安装并验证 Starcat CLI\n\n## 任务目标\n\n当前 AI Agent 安装官方 Starcat CLI，并完成版本检查和只读诊断。\n\n官方仓库：\n\n```text\n%1$@\n```\n\n## 安装步骤\n\n### 1. 判断操作系统\n\n根据当前运行环境选择对应的官方安装命令。\n\nmacOS / Linux：\n\n```bash\n%2$@\n```\n\nWindows PowerShell：\n\n```powershell\n%3$@\n```\n\n### 2. 检查 CLI 版本\n\n```bash\nstarcat version\n```\n\n如果 macOS/Linux 当前 shell 尚未刷新 PATH，改用：\n\n```bash\n\"$HOME/.local/bin/starcat\" version\n```\n\nWindows PowerShell 可通过以下命令查找安装路径：\n\n```powershell\n(Get-Command starcat).Source\n```\n\n### 3. 执行只读诊断\n\n```bash\nstarcat doctor\n```\n\n如果 macOS/Linux 当前 shell 尚未刷新 PATH，改用：\n\n```bash\n\"$HOME/.local/bin/starcat\" doctor\n```\n\n### 4. 处理未配对状态\n\n如果诊断结果显示 CLI 尚未配对：\n\n1. 停止后续连接验证。\n2. 报告“Starcat CLI 已安装，但尚未配对”。\n3. 提示用户打开 Starcat 的「设置 → MCP」。\n4. 提示用户使用 Starcat 提供的“复制配对提示词”功能完成配对。\n5. 不向用户索取单独的 pairing URI 或 Local API Key。\n\n## 操作边界\n\n- 只使用 Starcat 官方安装脚本。\n- 不修改当前项目文件。\n- 不执行 Starcat 写入命令。\n- 不索取 Local API Key。\n- 不自行构造 pairing URI 或配对命令。\n- 除非安装失败，否则不额外抓取 GitHub Release API 响应或打印安装脚本源码。\n\n## 完成后报告\n\n当前 AI Agent 最终报告：\n\n- 操作系统和 CPU 架构\n- CLI 是否安装成功\n- CLI 安装路径\n- CLI 版本\n- `starcat doctor` 结果\n- 是否需要用户继续完成设备配对"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "settings.mcp.agentSetup.cliLifecyclePrompt" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "# Install, Update, and Verify Starcat CLI\n\n## Goal\n\nThe current AI Agent ensures that the official Starcat CLI is installed, updates an existing installation when a newer stable release is available, and completes read-only diagnostics.\n\nOfficial repository:\n\n```text\n%1$@\n```\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Detect the operating system and locate an existing CLI\n\nDo this before running any installer.\n\nmacOS / Linux:\n\n```bash\ncommand -v starcat || true\n[ -x \"$HOME/.local/bin/starcat\" ] && echo \"$HOME/.local/bin/starcat\" || true\n```\n\nWindows PowerShell:\n\n```powershell\n(Get-Command starcat -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue).Source\n```\n\nRecord the resolved absolute executable path as `CLI_PATH` on macOS/Linux or `$cliPath` on Windows. If more than one installation is found, use the one returned by `command -v` / `Get-Command` and report the duplicate path; do not delete either installation.\n\n### 2. Install only when the CLI is missing\n\nIf no executable was found, select the official installer for the current environment.\n\nmacOS / Linux:\n\n```bash\n%2$@\n```\n\nWindows PowerShell:\n\n```powershell\n%3$@\n```\n\nAfter installation, locate the executable again and store its absolute path. If it is still unavailable, stop and report the installation failure.\n\n### 3. Check and update the installed version\n\nFirst record the current version, then run the official updater. The PATH form of the updater is `%4$@`; prefer the resolved absolute path so a stale shell PATH cannot select another binary.\n\nmacOS / Linux:\n\n```bash\n\"$CLI_PATH\" version\n\"$CLI_PATH\" update\n```\n\nWindows PowerShell:\n\n```powershell\n& $cliPath version\n& $cliPath update\n```\n\n`starcat update` checks the latest stable release and updates only when a newer version exists. If it reports that the installation is managed by Homebrew, use the package manager instead:\n\n```bash\nbrew update\nbrew upgrade starcat\n```\n\nAfter any update attempt, resolve the executable path again and run `version` again. If the updater reports a development build or a network, permission, checksum, or package-manager failure, do not overwrite the installation with another method; stop the update step and report the exact error.\n\n### 4. Run read-only diagnostics\n\nUse the final resolved executable path. For the default macOS/Linux installer path, the command is:\n\n```bash\n\"$HOME/.local/bin/starcat\" doctor\n```\n\nOn Windows, run `& $cliPath doctor`.\n\n### 5. Handle an unpaired CLI\n\nIf diagnostics report that the CLI is not paired:\n\n1. Stop further connection verification.\n2. Report that Starcat CLI is installed and current, but not paired.\n3. Instruct the user to open **Starcat > Settings > MCP**.\n4. Instruct the user to use Starcat's **Copy Pairing Prompt** action.\n5. Do not request a standalone pairing URI or Local API Key.\n\n## Boundaries\n\n- Use only Starcat's official installer, built-in updater, or Homebrew for a Homebrew-managed installation.\n- Do not reinstall over an existing CLI merely to check for updates.\n- Do not call the GitHub Releases API directly; `starcat update` owns version comparison and checksum verification.\n- Do not modify project files or execute Starcat write commands.\n- Do not request a Local API Key or construct a pairing URI.\n\n## Final Report\n\nReport the operating system and CPU architecture, CLI path, version before and after the check, whether installation or update was needed, update result, `starcat doctor` result, and whether device pairing is still required."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "# 安装、更新并验证 Starcat CLI\n\n## 任务目标\n\n当前 AI Agent 确保官方 Starcat CLI 已安装；如果已有安装且存在新的稳定版本，则完成更新，最后执行只读诊断。\n\n官方仓库：\n\n```text\n%1$@\n```\n\n## 执行流程\n\n### 1. 判断操作系统并查找已有 CLI\n\n必须先完成此步骤，再决定是否运行安装脚本。\n\nmacOS / Linux：\n\n```bash\ncommand -v starcat || true\n[ -x \"$HOME/.local/bin/starcat\" ] && echo \"$HOME/.local/bin/starcat\" || true\n```\n\nWindows PowerShell：\n\n```powershell\n(Get-Command starcat -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue).Source\n```\n\n将解析到的绝对可执行文件路径记录为 macOS/Linux 的 `CLI_PATH` 或 Windows 的 `$cliPath`。如果找到多个安装，优先使用 `command -v` / `Get-Command` 返回的路径，并报告重复路径；不要删除任何安装。\n\n### 2. 仅在 CLI 不存在时安装\n\n如果未找到可执行文件，才根据当前环境执行官方安装命令。\n\nmacOS / Linux：\n\n```bash\n%2$@\n```\n\nWindows PowerShell：\n\n```powershell\n%3$@\n```\n\n安装完成后重新查找可执行文件并记录绝对路径。如果仍然找不到，停止并报告安装失败。\n\n### 3. 检查并更新已安装版本\n\n先记录当前版本，再运行官方 updater。PATH 形式的更新命令是 `%4$@`；优先通过已解析的绝对路径执行，避免旧 PATH 选中另一份二进制。\n\nmacOS / Linux：\n\n```bash\n\"$CLI_PATH\" version\n\"$CLI_PATH\" update\n```\n\nWindows PowerShell：\n\n```powershell\n& $cliPath version\n& $cliPath update\n```\n\n`starcat update` 会检查最新稳定版，只在存在新版本时更新。如果它报告当前安装由 Homebrew 管理，则改用包管理器：\n\n```bash\nbrew update\nbrew upgrade starcat\n```\n\n完成更新尝试后，重新解析可执行文件路径并再次执行 `version`。如果 updater 报告开发版本，或出现网络、权限、校验和、包管理器错误，不要改用其他方式覆盖现有安装；停止更新步骤并原样报告错误。\n\n### 4. 执行只读诊断\n\n使用最终解析到的可执行文件绝对路径。对于 macOS/Linux 官方安装器的默认路径，命令是：\n\n```bash\n\"$HOME/.local/bin/starcat\" doctor\n```\n\nWindows 使用 `& $cliPath doctor`。\n\n### 5. 处理未配对状态\n\n如果诊断结果显示 CLI 尚未配对：\n\n1. 停止后续连接验证。\n2. 报告“Starcat CLI 已安装并完成版本检查，但尚未配对”。\n3. 提示用户打开 Starcat 的「设置 → MCP」。\n4. 提示用户使用 Starcat 提供的“复制配对提示词”功能。\n5. 不向用户索取单独的 pairing URI 或 Local API Key。\n\n## 操作边界\n\n- 只使用 Starcat 官方安装脚本、内置 updater；Homebrew 管理的安装只使用 Homebrew 更新。\n- 不要为了检查新版本而覆盖安装已有 CLI。\n- 不直接请求 GitHub Releases API；版本比较和校验和验证统一交给 `starcat update`。\n- 不修改当前项目文件，不执行 Starcat 写入命令。\n- 不索取 Local API Key，不自行构造 pairing URI。\n\n## 完成后报告\n\n报告操作系统和 CPU 架构、CLI 路径、检查前后版本、是否执行安装或更新、更新结果、`starcat doctor` 结果，以及是否仍需完成设备配对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
