    "settings.mcp.agentSetup.mcpManualPrompt" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "# Configure Starcat MCP Service Manually\n\n1. Run `command -v starcat` and copy the absolute path.\n2. Add a user-level stdio MCP Server to your client:\n   - Name: starcat\n   - Command: the absolute path from step 1\n   - Args: [\"mcp\"]\n   - Transport: stdio\n3. Keep Starcat running with MCP Service enabled.\n4. Restart or reload the MCP client, then complete initialize and tools/list, and call the read-only tool starcat.get_capabilities.\n\nDo not configure an endpoint or Local API Key in the MCP client."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "# 手动配置 Starcat MCP Service\n\n1. 运行 `command -v starcat` 并复制绝对路径。\n2. 在 MCP 客户端中添加用户级 stdio MCP Server：\n   - Name: starcat\n   - Command: 第 1 步得到的绝对路径\n   - Args: [\"mcp\"]\n   - Transport: stdio\n3. 保持 Starcat 运行并开启 MCP Service。\n4. 重启或重新加载 MCP 客户端，然后完成 initialize 和 tools/list，并调用只读工具 starcat.get_capabilities。\n\n不要在 MCP 客户端中配置 endpoint 或 Local API Key。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "settings.mcp.agentSetup.mcpPrompt" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "# Configure Starcat MCP Server\n\n## Goal\n\nThe current AI Agent configures a user-level Starcat stdio MCP Server through Starcat CLI and completes read-only connection verification.\n\n## MCP Parameters\n\n```text\nName: starcat\nTransport: stdio\nCommand: absolute path to Starcat CLI\nArgs: [\"mcp\"]\n```\n\nResulting launch command:\n\n```bash\nstarcat mcp\n```\n\n## Steps\n\n### 1. Locate Starcat CLI\n\nmacOS/Linux:\n\n```bash\ncommand -v starcat\n```\n\nIf the current shell has not refreshed PATH, check:\n\n```bash\ntest -x \"$HOME/.local/bin/starcat\" && echo \"$HOME/.local/bin/starcat\"\n```\n\nWindows PowerShell:\n\n```powershell\n(Get-Command starcat).Source\n```\n\nIf the CLI is not installed, run `%1$@` on macOS/Linux or `%2$@` in Windows PowerShell.\n\n### 2. Check connection state\n\n```bash\nstarcat doctor\n```\n\nIf the CLI is not paired:\n\n1. Stop MCP configuration.\n2. Report that the CLI is not paired.\n3. Instruct the user to use Starcat's pairing prompt, which contains a complete `starcat pair ...` command.\n4. Run `starcat doctor` again after pairing completes.\n\n### 3. Add a user-level MCP Server\n\nCodex:\n\n```bash\ncodex mcp add starcat -- \"<STARCAT_CLI_ABSOLUTE_PATH>\" mcp\n```\n\nClaude Code:\n\n```bash\nclaude mcp add -s user starcat -- \"<STARCAT_CLI_ABSOLUTE_PATH>\" mcp\n```\n\nOther MCP clients use this user-level configuration:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"starcat\": {\n      \"type\": \"stdio\",\n      \"command\": \"<STARCAT_CLI_ABSOLUTE_PATH>\",\n      \"args\": [\"mcp\"]\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\nChoose only the configuration method for the current AI Agent.\n\n### 4. Reload MCP configuration\n\nReload or restart the current MCP client. If the current session cannot reload the MCP Server, report that configuration was written and the user must restart the current AI Agent. Do not claim that the connection succeeded.\n\n### 5. Run read-only verification\n\nVerify in order:\n\n1. `initialize`\n2. `tools/list`\n3. `starcat.get_capabilities`\n\nDo not call write, delete, or summary-generation tools.\n\n## Boundaries\n\n- Create only a user-level MCP configuration.\n- Do not modify project-level MCP configuration.\n- MCP transport must be `stdio`.\n- Do not put an HTTP endpoint in MCP configuration.\n- Do not request or configure a Local API Key.\n- Do not store a Bearer Token, pairing URI, or other credential.\n- Do not execute Starcat write tools.\n- Do not modify unrelated files.\n\n## Final Report\n\nThe current AI Agent reports:\n\n- Current MCP client type\n- Absolute Starcat CLI path\n- MCP configuration location\n- Whether restart or reload is required\n- Whether `initialize` succeeded\n- Tool count returned by `tools/list`\n- Whether `starcat.get_capabilities` succeeded\n- Incomplete steps and their reasons"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "# 配置 Starcat MCP Server\n\n## 任务目标\n\n当前 AI Agent 使用 Starcat CLI 配置用户级 stdio MCP Server，并完成只读连接验证。\n\n## MCP 参数\n\n```text\nName: starcat\nTransport: stdio\nCommand: Starcat CLI 的绝对路径\nArgs: [\"mcp\"]\n```\n\n最终启动形式：\n\n```bash\nstarcat mcp\n```\n\n## 执行步骤\n\n### 1. 查找 Starcat CLI\n\nmacOS/Linux：\n\n```bash\ncommand -v starcat\n```\n\n如果当前 shell 尚未刷新 PATH，检查：\n\n```bash\ntest -x \"$HOME/.local/bin/starcat\" && echo \"$HOME/.local/bin/starcat\"\n```\n\nWindows PowerShell：\n\n```powershell\n(Get-Command starcat).Source\n```\n\n如果 CLI 尚未安装，macOS/Linux 运行 `%1$@`，Windows PowerShell 运行 `%2$@`。\n\n### 2. 检查连接状态\n\n```bash\nstarcat doctor\n```\n\n如果 CLI 尚未配对：\n\n1. 停止 MCP 配置。\n2. 报告“CLI 尚未配对”。\n3. 提示用户使用 Starcat 提供的配对提示词，其中包含完整的 `starcat pair ...` 命令。\n4. 配对完成后重新运行 `starcat doctor`。\n\n### 3. 添加用户级 MCP Server\n\nCodex：\n\n```bash\ncodex mcp add starcat -- \"<STARCAT_CLI_ABSOLUTE_PATH>\" mcp\n```\n\nClaude Code：\n\n```bash\nclaude mcp add -s user starcat -- \"<STARCAT_CLI_ABSOLUTE_PATH>\" mcp\n```\n\n其他 MCP 客户端使用以下用户级配置：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"starcat\": {\n      \"type\": \"stdio\",\n      \"command\": \"<STARCAT_CLI_ABSOLUTE_PATH>\",\n      \"args\": [\"mcp\"]\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n只选择与当前 AI Agent 对应的一种配置方式。\n\n### 4. 重新加载 MCP 配置\n\n配置完成后，重新加载或重启当前 MCP 客户端。如果当前会话无法重新加载 MCP Server，明确报告“配置已写入，需要用户重新启动当前 AI Agent”，不得直接宣称连接成功。\n\n### 5. 执行只读验证\n\n依次验证：\n\n1. `initialize`\n2. `tools/list`\n3. `starcat.get_capabilities`\n\n不得调用写入、删除或摘要生成工具。\n\n## 操作边界\n\n- 只创建用户级 MCP 配置。\n- 不修改项目级 MCP 配置。\n- MCP transport 必须是 `stdio`。\n- 不在 MCP 配置中填写 HTTP endpoint。\n- 不索取或配置 Local API Key。\n- 不写入 Bearer Token、pairing URI 或其他凭据。\n- 不执行 Starcat 写入工具。\n- 不修改无关文件。\n\n## 完成后报告\n\n当前 AI Agent 最终报告：\n\n- 当前 MCP 客户端类型\n- Starcat CLI 绝对路径\n- MCP 配置位置\n- 是否需要重启或重新加载\n- `initialize` 是否成功\n- `tools/list` 返回的工具数量\n- `starcat.get_capabilities` 是否成功\n- 尚未完成的步骤及原因"
          }
        }
      }
    },
