    "settings.mcp.agentSetup.skillManualPrompt" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "# Install starcat-skill Manually\n\nChoose one user-level destination.\n\nCodex:\n```bash\nmkdir -p \"$HOME/.codex/skills\"\ngit clone %1$@ \"$HOME/.codex/skills/starcat-skill\"\n```\n\nClaude Code:\n```bash\nmkdir -p \"$HOME/.claude/skills\"\ngit clone %1$@ \"$HOME/.claude/skills/starcat-skill\"\n```\n\nIf the destination already exists, update it with `git -C <skill-path> pull --ff-only`. Restart or reload the AI agent so it refreshes the Skill list, then invoke `$starcat-skill` with a read-only request to verify discovery."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "# 手动安装 starcat-skill\n\n选择一个用户级安装目录。\n\nCodex：\n```bash\nmkdir -p \"$HOME/.codex/skills\"\ngit clone %1$@ \"$HOME/.codex/skills/starcat-skill\"\n```\n\nClaude Code：\n```bash\nmkdir -p \"$HOME/.claude/skills\"\ngit clone %1$@ \"$HOME/.claude/skills/starcat-skill\"\n```\n\n如果目标目录已存在，请使用 `git -C <skill-path> pull --ff-only` 更新。随后重启或重新加载 AI Agent，让它刷新 Skill 列表，再通过 `$starcat-skill` 发起一个只读请求验证是否已识别。"
          }
        }
      }
